## Partials of a vibrating string

$$
y(x,t) = \sum_{n=1}^{\infty} A_n \sin\!\left(\frac{n \pi x}{L}\right) \cos\!\left(2\pi f_n t + \varphi_n\right),
\qquad
f_n = \frac{n}{2L}\sqrt{\frac{T}{\mu}} = n f_1
$$
```abc
%%stretchlast 1
X:1
M:C
L:1/4
K:C clef=treble
C, C G c | e g "^-31c"_b c' |]
w: n=1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
